message: "If you use this code, please cite this repository and identify the commit used."
title: "Structural context and women’s endorsement of justifications for intimate partner violence: analysis code and aggregate results"
authors:
  - family-names: "Alves"
    given-names: "Caroline Lourenco"
url: "https://github.com/Caroline070590/Harmful-social-norms-ipv-predictability"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Caroline070590/Harmful-social-norms-ipv-predictability"
abstract: "Analysis code and public aggregate results for a study of whether structural context predicts women's national average endorsement of justifications for intimate partner violence and the relative pattern across five situations, using official survey estimates with country-and-time and external validation. Individual-level source data require provider access."
keywords:
  - intimate partner violence
  - violence justification
  - social norms
  - cross-national prediction
  - machine learning
  - aggregate data
  - reproducibility
